SVG renderer notices
--------------------

The binary includes LunaSVG 3.5.0, pinned at commit
83c58df8103dc7dca423dfd824992af94d49bed6 in thirdparty/lunasvg/src
(https://github.com/sammycage/lunasvg), and its bundled PlutoVG 1.3.1
